From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 14:55:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 66/76] web-app: update emoji data to Unicode 17 (picker +
 completion)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

@emoji-mart/data (~Unicode 15) lacks newer emoji, so neither the emoji picker
nor the composer :emoji: completion could find/insert them (e.g. 🪎 treasure
chest, Unicode 17.0). A generated supplement (from emojibase-data — see
scripts/build-emoji-supplement.mjs) is folded into the dataset by a shared
emojiDataExtended module that both surfaces import instead of @emoji-mart/data.
Additive only; the base dataset is untouched. Supplement versions are capped at
15 so emoji-mart's emojiVersion filter (choices max out at 15) doesn't hide them.
---
 .../EmojiPicker/emoji-supplement.json         | 991 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../EmojiPicker/emojiDataExtended.ts          |  43 +
 .../src/components/EmojiPicker/index.tsx      |   2 +-
 .../composer/completion/emojiProvider.ts      |   2 +-
 4 files changed, 1036 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 packages/frontend/src/components/EmojiPicker/emoji-supplement.json
 create mode 100644 packages/frontend/src/components/EmojiPicker/emojiDataExtended.ts

diff --git a/packages/frontend/src/components/EmojiPicker/emoji-supplement.json b/packages/frontend/src/components/EmojiPicker/emoji-supplement.json
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..136f1f2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/frontend/src/components/EmojiPicker/emoji-supplement.json
@@ -0,0 +1,991 @@
